posts.body:
When hitting 3 or more enemies in a single attack, Mana +20%.
How to recreate this in rpg maker mv, using yanfly plugins
I tried this way but without success.
Code:
<Custom Conclude Effect>
var hits = 0;
for (var i = 0; i < targets.length; i++) {
  if (targets[i] && targets[i].result().isHit()) {
    hits++;
  }
}
if (hits >= 3) {
  var gain = Math.floor(user.mmp * 0.20);
  user.gainMp(gain);
}
</Custom Conclude Effect>

Don't you need to add there a line to tell what the 'targets' is?
Like below 'vat hits' add:
var targets = BattleManager._targets;
